# The shared lines, Phase 8 session 3 (Docs/Design/84 §33, §14.1's thin topics): the week's happenings at the market
# (talk.event). The topic's openers are the point here (§33.1), so these carry the concept; each hands on to
# event.answer with what kind of news it was ({ev=good}, {ev=bad}, {ev=loss}, {ev=news}: economy8_times.talk's tags),
# and the answers below are by the event's own kind, so a reply to the drovers speaks of the drovers.
#
# The facts (Core/RatwEvents.cpp World::eventFacts): world.event (the kind), world.event_words (its noun phrase: "the
# drovers and their herds", "the lame ox that held up the Greenholt cart"), world.event_goods (what its market deals
# in, "raw meat, mutton and hides"), world.event_when (now, soon, past). A House wedding is the city's alone, a ship's
# cargo or loss the Wharf's; the rest happen in any market, so a line that names a place is gated to its region.
#
# The rules they keep: never a price figure, and a good dear or cheap only where world.<good>_price says so; an event
# over is spoken of in the past; nobody claims to have seen what the game didn't show them (the notices and the criers
# are what everyone knows; "I'm told" for the rest); who says it by the grammar (#s8_heard#, plain.grammar), what about
# by the criteria. The phase's measure: in Phase 8 session 2's card the event topic fell to the authored route ("A day
# like any other.") 960 times of 1,964, its few openers spent; these are the more ways to say it.

## ================================================================ The drovers and their herds

rule s83e_drovers_1
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The drovers are in, then. | {ev=good} #s8_heard# The drovers have come in. | {ev=good} Drovers in today. Mind where you step.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Have you heard the bleating? The drovers are in. | {ev=good} Sheep in the lanes and the drovers shouting. Market week, all right. | {ev=good} The herds came in this morning. You'll have smelled them.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_3
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} There'll be meat on every table tonight, with the drovers in. | {ev=good} Butchers will be busy. The drovers are here. | {ev=good} Fresh meat at last. The drovers have brought their herds down.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_4
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} #surprise#! The drovers, and half the hills' sheep with them. | {ev=good} Drovers, herds, mud to the knee. You know the week. | {ev=good} The drovers are in. Shut your gate if you've got one.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_5
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} It's all talk of #world.event_words# today. | {ev=good} Nobody can talk of anything but #world.event_words#. | {ev=good} #world.event_words.capitalize#. That's the week sorted, then.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_6
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Drovers in. The tanners will have their work cut out. | {ev=good} A herd that size, there'll be hides drying on every fence. | {ev=good} Forty head in one drove, they say, and that's only the first.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_7
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} You can't hear yourself think for the bleating. | {ev=good} Drovers' week. The inns will be loud tonight. | {ev=good} The drovers are in, and they've thirst enough for the whole town.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_8
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now world.mutton_price=down
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Mutton's going cheap with the drovers in. | {ev=good} I'll be having mutton tonight. Cheap as I've seen it. | {ev=good} Get your mutton while it's cheap. The drovers won't stay.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_9
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now world.raw_meat_price=down
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Meat's cheap this week, with the herds in. | {ev=good} Cheap meat at last. The drovers have flooded the stalls. | {ev=good} I'll buy a joint while it's cheap. Who knows when it'll be again.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_herder
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.job=herder|farmer
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Good beasts in that drove, mostly. Hill sheep. | {ev=good} Those drovers push their stock too hard. You can see it in the legs. | {ev=good} Fine flock, that. I'd have liked a look at the ewes.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_cook
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.job=cook|innkeeper
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Stew for a week, with the drovers in. Mutton stew. | {ev=good} The drovers drink like the sea's dry. I've barrels ready. | {ev=good} I'll be buying more mutton than I've hooks for.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_crafter
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.job=crafter|laborer
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Hides and fleeces. There'll be work at the tannery this week. | {ev=good} The tannery's hiring hands while the hides last. | {ev=good} Every hide off that herd wants scraping. Someone's got to do it.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_merchant
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.role=merchant
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The drovers spend before they leave. It's a good week for the counter. | {ev=good} Drovers with coin in their pockets. Good for trade, that. | {ev=good} Rope, salve, a new strap. Drovers always want something.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_poor
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.wealth=poor|destitute
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Meat for once. Or the smell of it, anyway. | {ev=good} The drovers want hands to hold the gates. A penny's a penny. | {ev=good} I might stretch to a bit of mutton this week. Might.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_rich
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.wealth=rich
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The cook's gone down to choose a lamb herself. She trusts nobody. | {ev=good} The noise from those herds. One can't open a window. | {ev=good} Spring lamb on the table, with the drovers in. One small mercy.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_young
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.stage=young
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} There's sheep everywhere, they said! Hundreds! | {ev=good} I want to see the sheep! All of them! | {ev=good} Do sheep bite? I want to pat one.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_city
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Every butcher in town's sharpening his knives this week. | {ev=good} Herds down from the hills, and the streets all knees and bleating. | {ev=good} You'd think the whole of #here.town# had turned to sheep.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_town
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The whole place smells of sheep. I'm not complaining. | {ev=good} Drovers' week. The road's nothing but wool and dust. | {ev=good} There's more sheep than wolves in #here.town# today.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The drovers have gone. You can hear the birds again. | {ev=good} The herds moved on. The lanes'll take a week to clean. | {ev=good} Gone, the drovers. Left their mud behind, as ever.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_drovers_past2
when concept=talk.event world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} That was a good few days, with the drovers. | {ev=good} I miss the drovers already. Their coin, I mean. | {ev=good} The meat they left will last a while yet.
then other: event.answer

## ================================================================ The fire at the works

rule s83e_fire_1
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} #s8_heard# There's been a fire at the works. | {ev=bad} Fire at the works. Did you hear? | {ev=bad} The works caught fire. #uneasy#.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} They're still fighting the fire at the works, I'm told. | {ev=bad} Smoke over the works since morning. Bad business. | {ev=bad} A fire at the works. Bright One keep them all.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_3
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} No timber to be had, with the works burnt. | {ev=bad} Anyone wanting planks will be waiting a while, after that fire. | {ev=bad} The fire at the works. Nobody will be building this week.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_4
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} It's all talk of #world.event_words#. | {ev=bad} #world.event_words.capitalize#. That's all anyone talks of. | {ev=bad} You'll have heard of #world.event_words#. #pity#.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_5
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Fire's the one thing I'm truly afraid of. And now the works. | {ev=bad} I keep smelling smoke. Every time the wind turns. | {ev=bad} A spark and a dry beam, that's all it takes. Look at the works.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_planks
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now world.planks_price=up
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Planks have gone dear since the fire. | {ev=bad} You'll pay through the nose for a plank this week. The fire, see. | {ev=bad} Dear as anything, timber, with the works burnt.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_smith
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now self.job=smith
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Charcoal will be short, with the works burnt. A forge can't wait. | {ev=bad} No nails out of the works this week. I'll be making my own. | {ev=bad} A forge knows fire. That one got away from them.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_guard
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now self.job=guard|soldier
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} They'll want the Watch round the works till it's cold. | {ev=bad} Nobody goes near the works till it's cold. Watch orders. | {ev=bad} A fire like that, you keep your eyes open after. Sparks travel.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_carter
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now self.job=carter
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} There'll be no loads out of the works for a while. | {ev=bad} The works is shut, and my cart's empty. | {ev=bad} No loads from the works till they're built again.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_healer
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now self.job=healer|priest
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} If anyone's scorched, send them to me. Cold water first. | {ev=bad} Smoke in the chest is the worry after a fire. Honey helps. | {ev=bad} We'll say a word for the works at the evening prayers.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} They've the works going again, after the fire. Mostly. | {ev=bad} The fire's out at the works. You can still smell it on a damp day. | {ev=bad} They're putting up new beams at the works. Back to it.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_fire_past2
when concept=talk.event world.event=works_fire world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} That fire at the works. Could've been so much worse. | {ev=bad} After the fire, they've put water butts on every corner of the works. | {ev=bad} Everyone's minding their lamps since that fire.
then other: event.answer

## ================================================================ The brewers' glut

rule s83e_glut_1
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The brewers have overdone it. Barrels all down the lane. | {ev=good} #s8_heard# The brewers can't sell what they've brewed. | {ev=good} Too much ale in town, they say. Imagine that.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The brewers' glut. Best news all month. | {ev=good} There's a glut on at the brewers. A glut! Of ale! | {ev=good} You'll never guess what there's too much of. Ale.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_3
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} It's all talk of #world.event_words# at the stalls. | {ev=good} #world.event_words.capitalize#. Every inn in town is full. | {ev=good} Have you heard? #world.event_words.capitalize#.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_4
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Somebody's brewed for a festival that isn't coming. | {ev=good} The brewers guessed wrong, and the whole town's grateful. | {ev=good} The brewers are rolling barrels to anyone who'll take them.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_cheap
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now world.ale_price=down
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} #ale.capitalize#'s cheap all week. I'll do my part. | {ev=good} Ale for next to nothing, while the glut lasts. | {ev=good} Never seen #ale# so cheap. I'd buy a barrel if I had a cellar.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_cider
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now world.cider_price=down
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Cider's cheap with it, too. The glut's not only ale. | {ev=good} Cheap cider this week. Mind your head in the morning. | {ev=good} The cider presses overdid it too. Cheap as water.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_keeper
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now self.job=innkeeper
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The brewers are selling off. I'll have plenty in. | {ev=good} My cellar's full to the steps, with the brewers selling off. | {ev=good} I'll take a few barrels off the brewers for a song. Come round tonight.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_laborer
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now self.job=laborer|carter|miner|fisher
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} A week of plenty after a day's #work#. That's what I call justice. | {ev=good} The brewers' loss, my gain. I'll drink to them. | {ev=good} #ale.capitalize# by the barrel all week. My back says thank you.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_devout
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now self.piety=devout
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Too much ale in town. You can hear it from the chapel. | {ev=good} The brewers have a glut, and the young ones know it. | {ev=good} A glut of ale. The priest will have words on Restday.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The brewers' glut's done with. Back to proper prices. | {ev=good} That was a good week while it lasted, the glut. | {ev=good} Glut's over. The brewers have learnt, maybe.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_glut_past2
when concept=talk.event world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} I've still a jug from the glut put by. For a cold night. | {ev=good} Half the town's still nursing its head after that glut. | {ev=good} Nobody's sober memory of the glut, I'd wager.
then other: event.answer

## ================================================================ The lame ox

rule s83e_ox_1
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The farm cart's not come. Their ox went lame. | {ev=bad} #s8_heard# The cart's held up. A lame ox. | {ev=bad} No cart in today. Something with the ox.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} It's all talk of #world.event_words#. | {ev=bad} You'll have heard. #world.event_words.capitalize#. | {ev=bad} #world.event_words.capitalize#. Small thing, but the stalls feel it.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_3
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} One ox goes lame, and half the market's waiting. | {ev=bad} All it takes is one bad hoof, and there's no cart. | {ev=bad} The stalls are short today. The cart never came, ox gone lame.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_4
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The poor beast. I hope they're resting it. | {ev=bad} A lame ox and a cart stuck at the farm. Bad luck for somebody. | {ev=bad} Lame ox. The farm'll be sorry, and so will we.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_farmer
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now self.job=farmer|herder
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} You don't drive a beast on a bad hoof. They were right to hold the cart. | {ev=bad} Poultice and rest. That ox will be pulling again in a week. | {ev=bad} An ox is worth more than a day's selling. Every farmer knows it.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_carter
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now self.job=carter
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} I'd lend them my mule if they'd asked. | {ev=bad} I've seen a hoof go like that. It's the wet ground. | {ev=bad} Another carter's bad day. Could've been me.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_merchant
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now self.role=merchant
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} I was waiting on that cart. Half my stall's bare. | {ev=bad} No cart, so I've nothing fresh to set out. | {ev=bad} A lame ox, and my morning's gone.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_young
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now self.stage=young|adolescent
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The ox has a hurt foot. Will it get better? | {ev=bad} The cart's not coming because the ox is limping. | {ev=bad} I hope the ox is all right. Oxen are nice.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The cart's running again. Fresh ox in the shafts. | {ev=bad} That business with the ox is done. The cart came this morning. | {ev=bad} The farm cart's back. The stalls are full again.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_ox_past2
when concept=talk.event world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The ox is mending, I'm told. Good. | {ev=bad} One day without the cart, and everyone talked of nothing else. | {ev=bad} The lame ox is the market's old news already.
then other: event.answer

## ================================================================ Blight in the orchards

rule s83e_blight_1
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} There's blight in the orchards. #uneasy#. | {ev=bad} #s8_heard# The orchards have the blight. | {ev=bad} Blight on the apple trees, I'm told.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} It's all talk of #world.event_words#. | {ev=bad} #world.event_words.capitalize#. Nobody's happy about it. | {ev=bad} Have you heard? #world.event_words.capitalize#.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_3
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Blight. Black leaves, they say, and rot on the branch. | {ev=bad} The orchards have it bad. They're burning what's sick. | {ev=bad} Blight spreads like gossip. Faster.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_apples
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now world.apples_price=up
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Apples have gone dear, with the blight. | {ev=bad} An apple costs what a loaf did. The blight, see. | {ev=bad} You'll pay for an apple this week. Blight's taken the best of them.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_cider
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now world.cider_price=up
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Cider's dear already. The blight's got the orchards. | {ev=bad} No cheap cider this year, with the blight. | {ev=bad} The cider-makers are holding their prices high. Blight.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_farmer
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now self.job=farmer|herder|woodcutter
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Cut it out early and burn it, that's the only cure for blight. | {ev=bad} I've seen blight take a whole hillside. I pray it stops at the orchards. | {ev=bad} Wet spring, warm nights. Blight weather. I could have told them.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_cook
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now self.job=cook|baker|brewer
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} No apple pies this week. Tell the pups before they ask. | {ev=bad} I'd planned on cider for the stew. Not with this blight. | {ev=bad} What fruit there is, I'll have to fight for.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_young
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now self.stage=young
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The apple trees are poorly. I hope they get better. | {ev=bad} There's a sickness on the apples. I'm not to eat the spotty ones. | {ev=bad} Mum says no apples. Because of the blight.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The blight's run its course, they say. | {ev=bad} They burnt the sick trees. The rest look like they'll hold. | {ev=bad} Fewer apples this year, but the orchards will live.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_blight_past2
when concept=talk.event world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The orchards look bare where they cut the blight out. | {ev=bad} After the blight, every apple looks like treasure. | {ev=bad} The blight's gone. The smoke from the burning went on for days.
then other: event.answer

## ================================================================ The broken mill wheel

rule s83e_mill_1
when concept=talk.event world.event=mill_stopped world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The mill wheel's broken. No grinding till it's mended. | {ev=bad} #s8_heard# The mill's stopped. | {ev=bad} Mill wheel's cracked, I'm told. The bakers are worried.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_mill_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=mill_stopped world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
