rule s83e_mill_3
when concept=talk.event world.event=mill_stopped world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} No flour from the mill. It's never quiet like that. | {ev=bad} Funny how you only hear a mill when it stops. | {ev=bad} The wheel's stopped. They're up to their knees in the race, mending it.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_mill_flour
when concept=talk.event world.event=mill_stopped world.event_when=now world.flour_price=up
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Flour's dear with the mill stopped. | {ev=bad} You'll pay double for a sack of flour this week, near enough. | {ev=bad} Flour gone dear. The mill, see.
