then other: event.answer

rule s83e_mill_cook
when concept=talk.event world.event=mill_stopped world.event_when=now self.job=cook|innkeeper
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} No flour, so it's stew without dumplings. | {ev=bad} I've a sack put by. Not saying where. | {ev=bad} I'll thicken with barley till the mill's mended.
