rule s83e_catch_lake2
when concept=talk.event world.event=good_catch world.event_when=now here.region=coldwater
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Pike and perch to the gunwales, they say. | {ev=good} The lake's paid its debts this week. | {ev=good} Nets full on every boat. The lake remembers us sometimes.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_catch_fisher
when concept=talk.event world.event=good_catch world.event_when=now self.job=fisher|sailor
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Best haul all year, by the look of the boats. | {ev=good} There'll be gutting till midnight, and glad of it. | {ev=good} The nets near split. Never seen it so thick.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_catch_cook
when concept=talk.event world.event=good_catch world.event_when=now self.job=cook|innkeeper
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Fish soup for a week, with the catch in. | {ev=good} I'll be salting more fish than I've room for. | {ev=good} Fish on the menu, and fish on the floor. What a day.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_catch_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=good_catch world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The smokehouses are still full from the catch. | {ev=good} That catch will keep us in fish a while. | {ev=good} You could smell that catch for days.
then other: event.answer

