does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The salt pans flooded. #uneasy#. | {ev=bad} #s8_heard# No salt to be had. | {ev=bad} Salt's short. The pans are under water, I'm told.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_salt_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=salt_short world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} It's all talk of #world.event_words#. | {ev=bad} #world.event_words.capitalize#. Everyone's after salt. | {ev=bad} You'll have heard. #world.event_words.capitalize#.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_salt_dear
when concept=talk.event world.event=salt_short world.event_when=now world.salt_price=up
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} Salt's dear as silver this week. | {ev=bad} Salt by the pinch, now. The flood. | {ev=bad} Dear salt. And just when I'd meat to cure.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_salt_cook
when concept=talk.event world.event=salt_short world.event_when=now self.job=cook|innkeeper|fisher
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} No salt, no curing. I'll smoke what I can. | {ev=bad} I'm counting grains of salt like coin. | {ev=bad} Bland stew this week, and I'll hear about it.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_salt_old
when concept=talk.event world.event=salt_short world.event_when=now self.stage=old
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The pans flooded in my grandfather's day too. We managed. | {ev=bad} When the salt's short, the old folk remember. We kept a crock. | {ev=bad} Salt short. I've seen it before. It comes back.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_salt_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=salt_short world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=bad} The salt's back. The pans dried out. | {ev=bad} Salt on the stalls again, after the flood. | {ev=bad} The pans are working again, I'm told.
then other: event.answer

## ================================================================ The House wedding (the city's)

rule s83e_wedding_soon
when concept=talk.event world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=soon
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} A House wedding on the way, and the city's in a lather. | {ev=good} #s8_heard# One of the Houses is marrying. | {ev=good} There's a notice up. A House wedding, in a day or two.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_wedding_soon2
when concept=talk.event world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=soon
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The stewards are buying #world.event_goods# for the wedding. | {ev=good} Every kitchen up the hill is ordering #world.event_goods#. | {ev=good} The stewards want #world.event_goods#, and plenty.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_wedding_now
when concept=talk.event world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The House wedding's today. Carriages everywhere. | {ev=good} Have you seen the Heights? Ribbons on every door, for the wedding. | {ev=good} It's the House wedding. The whole city's craning its neck.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_wedding_now2
when concept=talk.event world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} It's all talk of #world.event_words#. | {ev=good} #world.event_words.capitalize#. Music up the hill all day. | {ev=good} #world.event_words.capitalize#. You'd think it was a festival.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_wedding_servant
when concept=talk.event world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=soon|now self.job=servant|cook
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Every servant up the hill is polishing silver for the wedding. | {ev=good} The kitchens up the hill work dawn to midnight, with the wedding. | {ev=good} The House wedding. My feet will never forgive it.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_wedding_lower
when concept=talk.event world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=soon|now self.class=lower
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} #toffs.capitalize# are marrying. We'll get a look at the carriages, if we're lucky. | {ev=good} A House wedding. Not that we'll taste a crumb of it. | {ev=good} The Houses wed and the rest of us carry the chairs.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_wedding_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} Did you see any of the House wedding? I heard the music three streets off. | {ev=good} The wedding's done. The Heights will talk of the dresses for a year. | {ev=good} After that wedding, the whole hill's asleep.
then other: event.answer

## ================================================================ A ship's rich cargo, a ship lost (the Wharf's)

rule s83e_cargo_soon
when concept=talk.event world.event=rich_cargo world.event_when=soon
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} There's a rich cargo coming in, I'm told. | {ev=good} #s8_heard# A ship's due with a rich hold. | {ev=good} The Wharf office has a notice up. A rich cargo, coming in.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_cargo_now
when concept=talk.event world.event=rich_cargo world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} #world.event_words.capitalize#. The Wharf's heaving with it. | {ev=good} There's #world.event_goods# off that ship at the Wharf. | {ev=good} It's all talk of #world.event_words#.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_cargo_now2
when concept=talk.event world.event=rich_cargo world.event_when=now
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} The whole city's down at the Wharf for that cargo. | {ev=good} A rich ship in. Even the Heights have come down the hill. | {ev=good} I've never seen the Wharf so busy. That cargo.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_cargo_merchant
when concept=talk.event world.event=rich_cargo world.event_when=soon|now self.role=merchant
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} I'll be down at the Wharf before dawn for that cargo. | {ev=good} If I can get a crate of what she brings, I'll sell it twice over. | {ev=good} A cargo like that sets the prices for a month.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_cargo_past
when concept=talk.event world.event=rich_cargo world.event_when=past
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=good} That rich cargo's all sold, I'm told. | {ev=good} The cargo's gone up the hill, as these things do. | {ev=good} You missed the cargo. Nothing left but the crates.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_lost_1
when concept=talk.event world.event=lost_ship
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=loss} #world.event_words.capitalize#. #pity#. | {ev=loss} You'll have heard. #world.event_words.capitalize#. | {ev=loss} The Wharf's in black. #world.event_words.capitalize#.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_lost_2
when concept=talk.event world.event=lost_ship
does tell.news
cooldown 1d
say {ev=loss} A ship lost. The Wharf office put the notice up this morning. | {ev=loss} Lost at sea. Every bell on the Wharf rang for her. | {ev=loss} The sea's taken a ship. You can feel it all down the hill.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_lost_sailor
when concept=talk.event world.event=lost_ship self.job=sailor|fisher
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=loss} Every sailor knows someone who sailed on her. #rest.capitalize#. | {ev=loss} Every sailor thinks it, every time. It'll be me one day. | {ev=loss} You don't talk about the sea when she's taken one. You just don't.
then other: event.answer

rule s83e_lost_merchant
when concept=talk.event world.event=lost_ship self.role=merchant
does tell.self
cooldown 1d
say {ev=loss} I'd goods coming on her. But that's nothing to the crew. | {ev=loss} Lost cargo, lost crew. The cargo can be replaced. | {ev=loss} The whole market's quiet. Nobody wants to haggle today.
then other: event.answer

