## ================================================================ The answers, by the event's own kind
# (event.answer: fit before the old answers by conv.ev alone, so a reply to the drovers speaks of the drovers; the old
# ones by wealth still hold beside them. Never a question here: an answer owes nothing.)

rule s83e_ans_drovers
when concept=event.answer world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does react.news
say Good. The town's been wanting meat. | Drovers' week. I'll keep my door shut. | #agree#. There's mud to the knee all down the lane. | Before dawn, they came in, I'm told.

rule s83e_ans_drovers2
when concept=event.answer world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now
does react.news.glad
say Meat on the table, then. #gladnews#. | That's the hills' best, coming in. | #gladnews#. I'll get a joint for Restday.

rule s83e_ans_drovers_poor
when concept=event.answer world.event=drovers_in world.event_when=now self.wealth=poor|destitute
does react.news
say Bones for soup, if I'm quick. | Cheap or dear, meat's not for me. | The smell of it's free, anyway.

rule s83e_ans_fire
when concept=event.answer world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now
does react.news.sorrow
say #pity#. I hope nobody was hurt. | Fire. #uneasy#. | #annoyed#. Just when folk were building. | A fire's a terrible thing.

rule s83e_ans_fire2
when concept=event.answer world.event=works_fire world.event_when=now
does react.news
say Smoke like that, you know something's wrong. | They'll build again. They always do. | I'll be minding my own hearth tonight. | Nobody'll sleep easy till it's cold.

rule s83e_ans_glut
when concept=event.answer world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now
does react.news.glad
say Then I know where I'm going tonight. | #funny#. A glut. Of ale. | The brewers' bad luck is the town's good luck. | I'll drink to that. Twice.

rule s83e_ans_glut_devout
when concept=event.answer world.event=brewers_glut world.event_when=now self.piety=devout
does react.news
say Ale's no answer to anything. | The young ones will be trouble this week. | Ale's no friend in the morning.

rule s83e_ans_ox
when concept=event.answer world.event=lame_ox world.event_when=now
does react.news
say Poor beast. They'll rest it, I hope. | One day without the cart. We'll manage. | That's farm life. Something always goes lame. | #notsobad#. The cart will come tomorrow.

rule s83e_ans_blight
when concept=event.answer world.event=orchard_blight world.event_when=now
does react.news.sorrow
say #uneasy#. Blight doesn't stop by itself. | #pity#. A whole year's growing. | Let's hope they burn it before it spreads. | No cider this winter, then.

rule s83e_ans_mill
when concept=event.answer world.event=mill_stopped world.event_when=now
does react.news
say Bread will be dear, then. #grumble#. | They'll mend it. Mills always need mending. | I've half a loaf put by. That's me sorted. | A day or two, they said. We'll see.

rule s83e_ans_catch
when concept=event.answer world.event=good_catch world.event_when=now
does react.news.glad
say Fish for supper, then. | #gladnews#. The boats earned it. | I'll take two, if they're cheap. | Good for the boats. They've had lean days.

rule s83e_ans_salt
when concept=event.answer world.event=salt_short world.event_when=now
does react.news
say Salt. You don't think about it till it's gone. | I'll ration mine, then. | Bland suppers for a while. | #grumble#. Everything comes dear at once.

rule s83e_ans_wedding
when concept=event.answer world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=soon|now
does react.news
say #toffs.capitalize# do like a show. | Let's hope they throw something to the gate. | Good luck to the pair. I'll not be invited. | I'll watch the carriages go by, and that'll do me.

rule s83e_ans_wedding_rich
when concept=event.answer world.event=house_wedding world.event_when=soon|now self.wealth=rich
does react.news
say One has had the invitation for a month. | Everyone will be there. Everyone who matters. | The seating will be a scandal, I promise you.

rule s83e_ans_cargo
when concept=event.answer world.event=rich_cargo world.event_when=soon|now
does react.news
say The Heights will buy it all before I get a look. | A rich ship's good for the whole Wharf. | I'll go down and gawp, if nothing else.

rule s83e_ans_lost
when concept=event.answer world.event=lost_ship
does react.news.sorrow
priority 3
say #rest.capitalize#. | #pity#. The poor families. | The sea's cruel. That's all there is to say. | Bright One, the crew.

rule s83e_ans_festival
when concept=event.answer world.event=festival_buying world.event_when=soon|now
does react.news.glad
say Festival's always dear. Worth it, mostly. | I'll buy mine today, then. | #gladnews#. A festival's what this town needs.

rule s83e_ans_soon
when concept=event.answer world.event_when=soon
does react.news
say I'll keep an eye out. | So the board says. | We'll see what comes of it. | Good to know before it's on us.

rule s83e_ans_past
when concept=event.answer world.event_when=past
does react.news
say Feels longer ago than it was. | That's done, then. On to the next thing. | The town's forgotten it already. | And there'll be something else next week.

rule s83e_ans_past2
when concept=event.answer world.event_when=past world.event=works_fire|orchard_blight|mill_stopped|salt_short|lame_ox
does react.news
say Glad that's over. | We got through it. Most do. | It could have been worse. | #notsobad#, in the end.

rule s83e_ans_merchant
when concept=event.answer world.event_when=now self.role=merchant
does react.news
say It's changed my prices, I'll tell you that. | I've had more folk asking about it than buying. | Good or bad for trade, it's talk for trade.

rule s83e_ans_young
when concept=event.answer self.stage=young
does react.news
say I want to go and see! | It sounds big. | I'll tell everyone! | Ooh.

rule s83e_ans_old
when concept=event.answer world.event_when=now self.stage=old
does react.news
say I've seen it before, and I'll see it again. | Every year something. Every year. | In my day it was the same, and we managed.
